%LC理
\dHimeo.\d%K%P
「我说，姫绪小姐」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dY-Yes...?\d%K%P
「在、在…」%K%P
And for some reason, she was being polite to me as well.%K%P
而且，她这次面对我时，\n不知为何表现得如此礼貌。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHow about you try using it for yourself? It's your first\nsalary, after all.\d%K%P
「偶尔也为自己花花钱吧？\n这可是你上班以来的第一份工资啊」%K%P
