%LC美都子
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dU-Um, so... I bought the money for myself because you\nhelp me all the time, and I thought I should pay you back\nsomehow. Oh yeah, this is the present.\d%K%P
「那、那个，所以说呢？\n我就是在想啊，要给经常照顾我的小都子买个礼物什么的。\n啊，礼物」%K%P
