%LC姬绪
\dY-Yes. That's right. You have my deepest gratitude.\d%K%P
「对、对，就是这样啊。\n一直以来受你照顾了…」%K%P
...She's been acting pretty weird ever since we decided\nshe should use her first salary for herself.%K%P
…她刚才就一直怪怪的。\n具体来说，是要靠自己的意志决定该如何使用第一次得到的工资。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI met her at the station on my way back, and helped her\ndecide on the present.\d%K%P
「…回来的途中我偶然遇上她了，\n就聊了聊该选什么礼物」%K%P
Well, I knew the first thing she would use her money on\nwould be a present for Mitoko.%K%P
『给小都子去买礼物』，\n不出所料，她果然想到了这一点。%K%P
But then she completely fell apart, getting more and more\nconfused and panicked when picking the present. In the\nend, she clung to me and pretty much blindly followed my\nrecommendations.%K%P
可是，那之后也没有决定。\n该做些什么也不清楚，结果自己也不能决定，\n只是听从着我的意见，唯命是从。%K%P
It definitely took a while, even after we had decided the\ntype of present she'd get. She kept changing her mind at\nthe shop, even returning to the register three times after\nshe'd already bought her gift.%K%P
要选哪种礼物，也是磨磨蹭蹭。\n在礼品店的门口转了又转，\n说着『决定了！』走进去，结果又回来了３次。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOh, so you finally got paid for that thing you keep\nmentioning! U-Um, can I open it?\d%K%P
