%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSure.\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯…」%K%P
By the way, the monetary value of the present was around\n1,000 yen. It was one of the factors that made her so\nhesitant to pick it.%K%P
多说一句，她正好花了１０００元。\n这个安定的价位，也是让她踌躇不已的因素之一。%K%P
Mitoko, now eagerly opening the package, probably already\nknew what was inside; it didn't take a genius to predict\nwhat it was from its size and form under the wrapping.%K%P
美都子激动地拆开了包装，\n实际上，包装和书店的纸袋大小差不多，\n里面是什么可想而知。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm... Ah, it's an English textbook!\d%K%P
「我看看…啊，英语的参考书啊！」%K%P
The present that I suggested and what Himeo picked was\nwithout a doubt something Mitoko currently needed.%K%P
我提出了备选方案，最后，姬绪小姐选择的是，\n没错，正是美都子现在最需要的。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIt is a new edition of the one I used back when I was in\nschool.\d%K%P
「是我以前用过那本的修订版…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn other words, it comes with the recommendation of\nsomeone who made it to Shuusen Preparatory.\d%K%P
