Mitoko's genuine smile and honest words seemed to have\nfinally dispelled at least a part of Himeo's nervousness\nas well.%K%P
她的表情和语气，还有那完全不做作伪装的笑容，\n渐渐消解了姫绪小姐紧张的情绪。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThank you, Himeo! I'll make sure to take good care of it,\nI swear!\d%K%P
