%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, that's right. ...Then I'll make sure to use it up!\d%K%P
「啊，也对…那我就拼命地用这本书了啊？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThanks... Toko. Ah, and there's something else,\nactually...\d%K%P
「嗯，谢谢你…小都子。\n啊，还有另一件礼物」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh? What is it?\d%K%P
「诶？还有吗？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWould you like to go shopping for clothes with me next\nSunday? You're going to be needing warmer clothes soon,\nright?\d%K%P
「这周日去买衣服吧？\n是时候该换衣服了，对吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
