...that both the value and the feeling behind this present\nand invitation were on a completely different level\ncompared to the \dsouvenirs\d she'd been receiving up until\nnow.%K%P
今天，还有周末的『礼物』，\n和普通的『土特产』，价值和意义完全不同。%K%P
