Meanwhile, Himeo seemed to have completely forgotten I was\nthere and flew off into her own world, clinging to Mitoko\nlike a parent to her baby.%K%P
仿佛完全无视了我一般，\n她紧紧地抱住美都子，\n享受着只属于二人的世界。%K%P
Still, I just didn't feel like ruining the mood this time.%K%P
不过，嘛，今天我还是不要多管闲事了。%K%P
After all, it was a day that marked all sorts of firsts\nfor Himeo.%K%P
因为今天，对姬绪小姐来说，是特别的第一天。%K%P
One of those uniquely eventful, memorable occasions she\nwould always remember; the kind people only experienced a\nprecious few times during their lives.%K%P
大概，在她至今为止的人生中，\n今天是扳着５个手指头都能数过来的、充实的一天吧。%K%P
