I felt this wasn't exactly the kind of conversation one\nshould be having after barging into a bachelor's room at\n3AM.%K%P
半夜３点，毫无预兆地跑到男人的房间里，\n大言不惭地说着别人的坏话。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWell, whatever. I came here tonight because I thought we\nshould make it perfectly clear where we stand.\d%K%P
