I knew they'd be some expensive presents, but this\nstaggering lack of common sense surpassed even my wildest\nexpectations.%K%P
想想也一定会是很贵的礼物，\n还真不出所料。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWell, even when I brought her less expensive things, she\ndidn't seem particularly interested. All I ever wanted was\nfor her to use them for herself.\d%K%P
「那些并不昂贵啊，但她还是不肯要…\n她只要能用上，我就很开心了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... Honestly, I've been meaning to ask, but...\d%K%P
「我说啊，\n之前我问过，实际上已经问了好几次了…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou mean why I'm so obsessed with Mitoko?\d%K%P
「『为什么你对美都子如此执着呢？』」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Exactly.\d%K%P
「…你答对了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou really want to know?\d%K%P
「你那么想知道吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf possible...\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHmm... I wonder if I should tell you.\d%K%P
「哼嗯…怎么说呢」%K%P
Himeo glanced up at the ceiling for a moment.%K%P
她抬起头，望向了天花板。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
But I kept looking straight at her, waiting for her to\ncontinue.%K%P
我凝视着她的脸，\n静静地等待着她的答复。%K%P
After all...%K%P
因为…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWell, okay. I'll tell you. Today's all sorts of special,\nafter all.\d%K%P
「哎，算了，我告诉你吧。\n因为，今天很特别」%K%P
The fact she stated the question I was going to ask\nindicated she at least entertained the idea of answering\nit.%K%P
仿佛读出了我的疑问一般，\n她下决心做出回答了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dLook. Do you know who this is?\d%K%P
「那个啊…\n这个，你知道是谁吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA photograph...?\d%K%P
「相片…吗」%K%P
The way she had that photo at the ready was kind of\ntelling. She must've considered talking about this even\nbefore coming to my room.%K%P
她从口袋里取出了准备好的相片，\n一副兴致满满想要说的样子，这让我更好奇了。%K%P
The old, slightly discolored photo showed a middle-aged\nman wearing an awkward smile.%K%P
只见有些褪色的相片上，\n有个４０岁左右的、\n露出了些羞涩笑容的男性。%K%P
He was holding a baby in his arms.%K%P
以及他怀中抱着的，\n哭哭啼啼、牙还没有长出来的婴儿。这是他们的合影。%K%P
That was...%K
这个是…%K
Himeo's father
姬绪和父亲？
Mitoko's father
美都子和父亲？
